
@startuml
actor User
participant "Resume Service" as RS
participant "Template Service" as TS
participant "Notification Service" as NS
participant "Payment Service" as PS
actor Admin

User -> RS: 1. Click 'Build Your CV'
RS -> TS: 2. Prompt to Choose Template
TS -> User: 3. Display Template Options
User -> TS: 4. Select Template
TS -> RS: 5. Send Selected Template
RS -> User: 6. Prompt to Fill Details (Contact, Experience, Education, Certifications, Skills, Summary, Reference, Finalize)
User -> RS: 7. Fill and Submit Details
RS -> User: 8. Display 'CV Creation Completed' message
RS -> User: 9. Push to get CV further reviewed by Admin
User -> RS: 10. Choose how CV will be returned (profile, download, email)
RS -> User: 11. Prompt Payment Plan (Standard £50, Priority £80)
User -> PS: 12. Select Payment Plan
PS -> PS: 13. Process Payment
PS -> RS: 14. Payment Confirmation
RS -> User: 15. Prompt to Login or Register
User -> RS: 16. Login or Register
RS -> Admin: 17. Connect to CV Expert
RS -> User: 18. Push 'review in progress' message
Admin -> RS: 19. Update CV
Admin -> ReS: 20. Complete review and provide feedback
ReS -> NS: 21. Notify User of review completion
NS -> User: 22. Send Notification
ReS -> User: 23. Update status to completed
User -> RS: 24. Login to view reviewed CV
RS -> User: 25. Display reviewed CV and feedback
RS -> User: 26. Provide Download Link (PDF or DOC)
RS -> User: 27. Send CV to User's Email
User -> RS: 28. Download CV
@enduml
